sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Bitrix as Веб-портал (Битрикс)
    participant API as FastAPI Router
    participant Sec as Security (X-API-Key)
    participant TS as TranslationService
    participant GS as GlossaryService (pymorphy3)
    participant PS as PromptService
    participant LLM as LLMClient (MLX / LiteLLM)

    Bitrix->>API: POST /api/v1/translate (JSON payload + X-API-Key)
    API->>Sec: verify_api_key(x_api_key)
    alt Неверный ключ
        Sec-->>Bitrix: 401 Unauthorized
    end
    API->>TS: translate(TranslationRequest)
    TS->>GS: match_terms(text, limit)
    Note over GS: Лемматизация слов текста через pymorphy3<br/>Поиск пересечений с индексами терминов
    GS-->>TS: list[GlossaryTerm]
    TS->>PS: build_user_prompt(title/body, terms)
    PS-->>TS: user_prompt_string
    TS->>LLM: generate(SYSTEM_PROMPT, user_prompt)
    Note over LLM: Инференс MiLMMT 12B (Local)<br/>или запрос к LiteLLM-прокси
    LLM-->>TS: translation_text
    TS-->>API: TranslationResponse
    API-->>Bitrix: 200 OK (JSON с переводом и метриками)
